Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:55:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 15/19] Add debug commands: sensor_reg and set_xclk

Read/write OV2640 registers (bit 8 = sensor bank) and change XCLK at runtime,
over serial or POST /api/debug/reg/ and /api/debug/xclk/, for live tuning
experiments without reflashing. Not saved.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
